<title>CHINA: ABN AMRO launches warrants on China Gas.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO launches warrants on China Gas.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Wednesday it launched 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong and China Gas Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$16.85     PREMIUM	  15.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.2595    GEARING	  6.49X</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$16.85     PAYDATE	  19.AUG.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	29.MAY.98    LISTING DATE   22.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG    MIN. EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>		     ISSUER'S CHOICE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
